        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we develop our relationship with the customer, we collect information from our subscribers about what products they are purchasing, their customer experience, and any feedback they have on our free and paid products.",
        "start_character": 7699,
        "end_character": 7918
      },
      {
