        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over our greater than 25-year history, we have developed a breadth of products and services that are designed to educate, empower, and entertain our subscribers and provide them with actionable investment ideas.",
        "start_character": 9495,
        "end_character": 9706
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001805651-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001805651-26-000016-2ef5b0ad74e9331b",
        "accession_number": "0001805651-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over the past several years, we have developed several joint ventures and executed strategic acquisitions to accelerate our growth, as well as increase the value of our offerings to our subscribers.",
        "start_character": 10503,
        "end_character": 10701
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001805651-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001805651-26-000016-2ef5b0ad74e9331b",
        "accession_number": "0001805651-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have also developed various software applications that provide customers with algorithmic tools to search for trading ideas and manage portfolio risk.",
        "start_character": 10179,
        "end_character": 10332
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001805651-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001805651-26-000016-2ef5b0ad74e9331b",
        "accession_number": "0001805651-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed screeners, monitors, portfolio management tools, and a set of proprietary indicators that produce a composite score to rank several thousand publicly traded companies in the United States.",
        "start_character": 5392,
        "end_character": 5598
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001805651-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001805651-26-000016-2ef5b0ad74e9331b",
        "accession_number": "0001805651-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We will continue to enhance our value proposition and create additional selling opportunities through an expanded product portfolio.",
